		{ String _name = "DSChapelofErnestTip";			String _text = "Build the Chapel of St. Ernest, matey - a Cleric be required to perform the services. The chapel gives yer crew a place to meet and worship, and provides spiritual happiness for up to 201 members - this includes the Cleric also. 7x10 tiles. Construction requires 155 Build work. Only one Chapel of St. Ernest can be built on a map."; }
		
